(text "5 V sensor output: TPS2553-1 latch-off version, EN tied to input.\n59k current-limit resistor. Cycle board power to clear overload.\nFAULT_N goes to MCU PA4, with a firmware-enabled pull-up.\nDesign target: 300mA combined load on this rail, not per connector.\nDo not back-power either sensor supply output." (at 25 110 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cf43f91e-82d2-562c-9a90-290d04c2dba3"))
